2. MODIFICATIONS BY MEDCOEL (ADAPTATION NOTICE)
-----------------------------------------------

    skeletal.glb - auditory ossicle nodes (Malleus, Incus, Stapes) removed.
    visceral.glb - kidney and renal pelvis nodes removed.
    nervous.glb  - not distributed.

Removal was lossless (licensing/tools/glb-prune.mjs): the remaining geometry is
byte-identical to the upstream export. The same notice is embedded in each
modified file (asset.extras.medcoelModificationNotice).


